Description: Vietnamese Input Method for Linux Wayland and X11
 VNSnowKey is a Vietnamese Input Method (BambooEngine core, evdev + uinput +
 XKB 8-level overlay) supporting KDE Plasma, GNOME, Hyprland, Sway, and X11
 sessions.
